They're there to be noticed. You do sometimes see it on Twitter. Someone will ask a question and terminate it with an entero bank. But then they'll stick in hash, entero bank, just to make sure that you've got the joke, that you've absolutely saw what they were doing. So the banality isn't there yet, it still stands out. And for Keith, this is the brass ring of punctuation,
